    "term": "EOBT",
    "fullName": "Estimated off-block time",
    "description": "Estimated Off-Block Time (EOBT) is the scheduled time at which an aircraft is expected to begin moving from its parking stand (pushback or forward movement), as filed in the flight plan. EOBT is used by ATC slot allocation systems (ATFM) to calculate the target departure flow and issue CTOTs. Updates to EOBT should be transmitted to ATC/slot coordinator if delays exceed 15 minutes.",
    "category": "NOTAM",
