    "fullName": "LANDING MINIMUMS",
    "description": "The minimum visibility prescribed for landing a civil aircraft while using an instrument approach procedure. The minimum applies with other limitations set forth in 14&#xA0;CFR part&#xA0;91 with respect to the Minimum Descent Altitude (MDA) or Decision Height (DH) prescribed in the instrument approach procedures as follows:",
